# Requests for the VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client / Visual Studio.
# All flights are generated demo data ("dataSource": "demo").
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@date = 2026-11-02
@returnDate = 2026-11-06

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Airport search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/airports?query=lon&limit=10

### Destinations served from Budapest
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/airports/BUD/destinations

### One-way search, cheapest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/search?origin=BUD&destination=LHR&departureDate={{date}}&adults=1

### Return search, 2 adults + 1 child, departing after 10:00, sorted by departure time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/search?origin=BUD&destination=CDG&departureDate={{date}}&returnDate={{returnDate}}&adults=2&children=1&sort=departure&departAfter=10:00

### Lowest fare per day (calendar price hints)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/lowest-fares?origin=BUD&destination=LHR&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### Register (demo account; use any address you control or example.com)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "traveller@example.com", "password": "Correct-Horse-9", "firstName": "Ada", "lastName": "Lovelace" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "traveller@example.com", "password": "Correct-Horse-9" }

### Profile (uses the access token from the login response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh (each refresh token works once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}" }

### Create a booking (hold for 20 minutes). Paste a flight id from a search result.
# Repeat with the same Idempotency-Key to get the same booking back (200, Idempotent-Replayed: true).
# @name booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 0193b3c2-8a7e-7c4d-9f00-000000000001

{
  "outbound": { "flightId": "<flight-id-from-search>", "fareFamily": "Plus" },
  "return": null,
  "passengers": [ { "firstName": "Ada", "lastName": "Lovelace", "type": "Adult" } ]
}

### My bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Booking details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{booking.response.body.reference}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Seat map for the outbound segment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{booking.response.body.reference}}/segments/{{booking.response.body.segments[0].id}}/seat-map
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Choose a seat
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{booking.response.body.reference}}/segments/{{booking.response.body.segments[0].id}}/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": [ { "passengerId": "{{booking.response.body.passengers[0].id}}", "seatNumber": "12C" } ] }

### Cancellation quote
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{booking.response.body.reference}}/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cancel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{booking.response.body.reference}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}" }
